  description: '2 Level 5 "Noble Knight" monsters

    When this card is Xyz Summoned:
    You can target up to 3 "Noble Arms" Equip Spell Cards with different names in
    your Graveyard; equip those targets to this card. Once per turn: You can detach
    1 Xyz Material from this card, then target 1 other monster on the field; destroy
    that target. If this card is sent from the field to the Graveyard: You can target
    1 Level 4 or higher "Noble Knight" monster in your Graveyard; Special Summon
    that target.'
